    "summary": "The mine’s bearer can use it at the opening of your Shooting phase, once per battle. Select one enemy unit the bearer can see at a distance of up to 9″. Roll a D6. A 3+ deals D3 mortal wounds; if the target is a VEHICLE unit or a FORTIFICATIONS unit, it suffers 2D3 instead. A Remote Mine token can sit beside the unit until the ability has been used.",
